{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q726795","formula":"C₇H₈","hill":"C7H8","elements":["H","C"],"composition":{"C":7.0,"H":8.0},"names":{"en":"2,5-norbornadiene","ru":"Норборнадиен"},"descriptions":{"en":"Norbornadiene is an organic compound and a bicyclic hydrocarbon. Norbornadiene is of interest as a metal-binding ligand, whose complexes are useful for homogeneous catalysis. It has been intensively studied owing to its high reactivity and distinctive structural property of being a diene that cannot isomerize (isomers would be anti-Bredt alkenes).","ru":"Норборнадиен — бициклический напряжённый диен, производное норборнана, обладает очень высокой химической активностью. Для стабилизации при хранении к нему добавляют ингибитор 2,6-ди-трет-бутил-4-метилфенол (0,05 %). При стандартных условиях представляет собой бесцветную жидкость."},"fame":21,"pubchemCid":8473,"mass":92.14,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1C2C=CC1C=C2","inchikey":"SJYNFBVQFBRSIB-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"bicyclo[2.2.1]hepta-2,5-diene","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"8473","atoms":15,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.0,"y":-1.118,"z":0.287,"el":"C"},{"x":0.0,"y":1.118,"z":0.288,"el":"C"},{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":1.341,"el":"C"},{"x":1.234,"y":0.674,"z":-0.479,"el":"C"},{"x":1.234,"y":-0.674,"z":-0.479,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.234,"y":0.674,"z":-0.479,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.234,"y":-0.674,"z":-0.479,"el":"C"},{"x":0.0,"y":-2.127,"z":0.698,"el":"H"},{"x":0.0,"y":2.127,"z":0.698,"el":"H"},{"x":-0.891,"y":0.0,"z":1.984,"el":"H"},{"x":0.89,"y":0.0,"z":1.984,"el":"H"},{"x":1.949,"y":1.317,"z":-0.966,"el":"H"},{"x":-1.948,"y":1.317,"z":-0.966,"el":"H"},{"x":1.949,"y":-1.317,"z":-0.966,"el":"H"},{"x":-1.949,"y":-1.317,"z":-0.966,"el":"H"}],"bonds":[[0,2,1],[0,4,1],[0,6,1],[0,7,1],[1,2,1],[1,3,1],[1,5,1],[1,8,1],[2,9,1],[2,10,1